WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.880
Welcome to Bravo. In this guide, we'll take
our time and learn the website

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:10.000
together. You'll see how to sign in, build a
training schedule, change or cancel

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.810
a visit, and ask for help. We're using a
demo account and sample dates.

4
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.640
Follow along with your own account when
you're ready, and pause whenever you

5
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:19.630
need more time.

6
00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:27.997
Start at Bravo Unleashed dot com, slash
account. Choose Sign in.

7
00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:31.977
Enter the name or email connected to your
account, then your password.

8
00:00:32.507 --> 00:00:35.017
Here, we're signing in as Demo Client.

9
00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:39.477
If Bravo gave you a temporary password, use
that for this first visit.

10
00:00:39.867 --> 00:00:44.267
If you don't have an account or training
access yet, contact Bravo so the team

11
00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:45.557
can help you get set up.

12
00:00:48.851 --> 00:00:51.741
On your first sign-in, you may see Create
your password.

13
00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:55.751
Choose a new password with at least twelve
characters, different from the

14
00:00:55.751 --> 00:01:00.311
temporary one. Enter the same new password
in both boxes, then choose Save

15
00:01:00.311 --> 00:01:02.041
password and open schedule.

16
00:01:02.591 --> 00:01:05.501
Your temporary password stops working after
this step.

17
00:01:05.971 --> 00:01:10.221
Returning members usually skip this screen
and sign in with their own password.

18
00:01:13.641 --> 00:01:15.571
Your account is your home base.

19
00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:19.681
The next-step card shows your upcoming visit
when you have one, and your

20
00:01:19.681 --> 00:01:24.281
training membership dates. Notice that
membership coverage and booked visits are

21
00:01:24.281 --> 00:01:28.591
separate: an active membership doesn't mean
every day is already scheduled.

22
00:01:29.061 --> 00:01:31.271
Use Manage Schedule to choose your visits.

23
00:01:32.101 --> 00:01:36.091
Message Bravo is nearby whenever you need
help. Let's open the schedule.

24
00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:41.440
First, check the schedule month.

25
00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:44.080
You can change it when you need to view
another month.

26
00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:47.560
In the saved calendar, filled gold dates
have visits.

27
00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:50.040
An outline marks the date you're viewing.

28
00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.820
Tap a date to read its details below the
calendar.

29
00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:56.220
A blank date means no saved visit that day.

30
00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:59.960
All times shown here are local to Aberdeen,
South Dakota.

31
00:02:03.404 --> 00:02:07.114
Choose Add or Cancel Date. This opens the
editor.

32
00:02:07.484 --> 00:02:11.144
We'll select Thursday the twenty-second and
Friday the twenty-third.

33
00:02:11.144 --> 00:02:13.834
You can choose several dates before choosing
a time.

34
00:02:14.344 --> 00:02:16.494
Gold now means selected for editing.

35
00:02:17.024 --> 00:02:21.864
Tapping a selected date again only deselects
it; that does not cancel a saved

36
00:02:21.864 --> 00:02:26.104
visit. Dates you can't choose may be outside
your coverage or the trainer's

37
00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:27.254
available schedule.

38
00:02:30.633 --> 00:02:36.103
Scroll to Choose one time for all selected
dates. We'll choose eleven A.M.

39
00:02:36.313 --> 00:02:38.883
That time is applied to both dates we
selected.

40
00:02:39.313 --> 00:02:43.383
It can also replace the current time on
selected dates that already have visits,

41
00:02:43.693 --> 00:02:45.383
so check your selection carefully.

42
00:02:46.073 --> 00:02:48.483
Use the available times shown for your
account.

43
00:02:48.953 --> 00:02:52.003
For a different time on another day, add
that day separately.

44
00:02:55.432 --> 00:03:00.062
If Save changes is unavailable, check for a
selected date without a time.

45
00:03:00.452 --> 00:03:03.922
Here we've also selected Monday, but haven't
chosen its time.

46
00:03:04.332 --> 00:03:07.142
The page asks us to choose a time before
saving.

47
00:03:07.512 --> 00:03:11.122
We can assign one, or deselect Monday if we
don't want it.

48
00:03:11.312 --> 00:03:15.552
We'll deselect Monday. Our original two
dates still have their times and are

49
00:03:15.552 --> 00:03:16.482
ready to save.

50
00:03:19.804 --> 00:03:22.294
Before saving, read Review and save.

51
00:03:22.624 --> 00:03:27.174
Our summary says two to add and zero to
cancel. Check every date and time.

52
00:03:27.484 --> 00:03:30.514
You can include a note to Bravo if the team
needs context.

53
00:03:30.944 --> 00:03:35.354
When everything looks right, choose Save
changes and wait for the saved message.

54
00:03:35.924 --> 00:03:39.214
Selecting dates or times alone does not
finish the job.

55
00:03:39.624 --> 00:03:41.934
The save step is what submits your changes.

56
00:03:45.423 --> 00:03:48.253
Back on the calendar, our two dates are
filled gold.

57
00:03:48.663 --> 00:03:51.813
Tap one and check the date, time, dog, and
trainer.

58
00:03:52.403 --> 00:03:56.673
Notice the status: Requested means the visit
is awaiting Bravo's confirmation.

59
00:03:57.423 --> 00:03:59.373
Confirmed means it has been confirmed.

60
00:04:00.203 --> 00:04:03.573
Membership covered describes payment
coverage, not confirmation.

61
00:04:04.183 --> 00:04:08.303
If you ever wonder whether a change saved,
return to this calendar and read the

62
00:04:08.303 --> 00:04:08.993
visit details.

63
00:04:12.489 --> 00:04:14.659
Let's add a day with a different time.

64
00:04:15.009 --> 00:04:19.549
Reopen Add or Cancel Date and select only
Monday the twenty-sixth.

65
00:04:19.549 --> 00:04:23.219
Choose two P.M., review the summary, and
save.

66
00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:27.039
The earlier dates stay in the schedule
because we didn't change them.

67
00:04:27.369 --> 00:04:31.709
This is the same process you'll use whenever
you want another available visit

68
00:04:31.709 --> 00:04:33.519
within your active training period.

69
00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:39.019
Now let's move an existing visit.

70
00:04:39.329 --> 00:04:42.579
From the saved calendar, tap Thursday the
twenty-second.

71
00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:45.779
In its visit details, choose Change day or
time.

72
00:04:46.369 --> 00:04:49.669
Set the new date to Tuesday the
twenty-seventh, then choose Find available

73
00:04:49.669 --> 00:04:54.839
times. Pick a new time from that list. We're
choosing ten A.M.

74
00:04:55.009 --> 00:04:58.849
This changes the existing visit, so you
don't need to leave a duplicate on the

75
00:04:58.849 --> 00:04:59.419
old day.

76
00:05:02.753 --> 00:05:06.783
Check the new date and time, then choose
Save and notify team.

77
00:05:07.333 --> 00:05:10.443
After saving, open the new date and verify
the details.

78
00:05:11.053 --> 00:05:13.443
Tuesday now shows ten A.M.

79
00:05:13.593 --> 00:05:18.053
You can also back out before submitting a
change or cancellation: here we open

80
00:05:18.053 --> 00:05:22.323
Cancel this visit, then choose Keep current
visit. Nothing is cancelled.

81
00:05:22.693 --> 00:05:24.323
Always read the final status.

82
00:05:27.796 --> 00:05:32.536
To remove a day, open Add or Cancel Date and
select the date that already has a

83
00:05:32.536 --> 00:05:35.616
visit. We'll remove Friday the twenty-third.

84
00:05:35.616 --> 00:05:37.906
Choose Cancel visits on selected dates.

85
00:05:38.376 --> 00:05:42.906
Read the review: it should show one to
cancel, and that date as a day off.

86
00:05:43.196 --> 00:05:47.856
Then save. Just tapping the date off or
clearing your selection would not cancel

87
00:05:47.856 --> 00:05:48.906
the saved visit.

88
00:05:52.317 --> 00:05:55.267
Made a mistake before saving? You have a way
back.

89
00:05:55.497 --> 00:05:59.187
Watch us select another date and time, then
choose Reset changes.

90
00:05:59.817 --> 00:06:01.687
The unsaved changes disappear.

91
00:06:02.117 --> 00:06:05.947
You can also leave with Discard changes and
back when that option appears.

92
00:06:06.617 --> 00:06:10.417
These controls affect the draft you're
editing; they don't undo changes you

93
00:06:10.417 --> 00:06:15.487
already saved. For a saved change, reopen
the relevant visit and correct it.

94
00:06:18.786 --> 00:06:22.866
Cancelling a visit does not automatically
extend your membership or create a

95
00:06:22.866 --> 00:06:27.816
refund. Changes within twenty-four hours
follow Bravo's appointment policy.

96
00:06:28.286 --> 00:06:32.006
If you need a credit for missed training,
contact the team so they can review

97
00:06:32.006 --> 00:06:37.276
it. A date marked Credit shows credited
coverage, but still needs a booked time.

98
00:06:37.766 --> 00:06:41.796
Check your membership end date, and contact
Bravo if you need help renewing.

99
00:06:45.089 --> 00:06:47.159
Want a copy you can keep or print?

100
00:06:47.409 --> 00:06:50.579
Choose the correct month, then tap Download
PDF.

101
00:06:51.109 --> 00:06:54.749
Depending on your browser, it may open the
document or save it to your

102
00:06:54.749 --> 00:06:58.859
downloads. The copy includes saved visits
and their statuses.

103
00:06:59.329 --> 00:07:02.079
Remember, a downloaded file is a snapshot.

104
00:07:02.549 --> 00:07:06.409
If you change your schedule later, download
a fresh copy so you're looking at

105
00:07:06.409 --> 00:07:07.319
the latest plan.

106
00:07:10.666 --> 00:07:13.736
For help, return to your account and choose
Message Bravo.

107
00:07:14.126 --> 00:07:17.756
You can address an available team member or
choose a particular trainer.

108
00:07:18.286 --> 00:07:22.646
This is a shared support thread: you and the
Bravo team can read it, even when

109
00:07:22.646 --> 00:07:24.016
you select one trainer.

110
00:07:24.526 --> 00:07:27.896
Include your dog's name, the relevant date,
and your question.

111
00:07:28.646 --> 00:07:30.016
Choose Send message when you're ready.

112
00:07:30.366 --> 00:07:33.236
For urgent needs, use the site's phone
contact.

113
00:07:36.635 --> 00:07:41.045
If you'd like the site to be easier to read,
open the A A Accessibility button.

114
00:07:41.515 --> 00:07:45.785
You can turn on larger text, increase
contrast, or reduce motion.

115
00:07:46.235 --> 00:07:48.145
There's also a site-music control.

116
00:07:48.555 --> 00:07:52.545
These preferences stay on this device, so
adjust them to suit you.

117
00:07:52.655 --> 00:07:54.285
Close the panel when you're finished.

118
00:07:54.735 --> 00:07:57.325
You can return to these controls whenever
you like.

119
00:08:00.633 --> 00:08:04.513
If dates or times aren't available, first
check that you're signed in to the

120
00:08:04.513 --> 00:08:08.603
right account and viewing the right month.
Check your membership dates too.

121
00:08:09.033 --> 00:08:11.783
Availability depends on coverage and the
trainer's schedule.

122
00:08:12.293 --> 00:08:16.523
If saving shows an error, read it and check
the calendar before trying again.

123
00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:20.603
If you're still stuck, send Bravo the date
and what the screen says.

124
00:08:20.993 --> 00:08:22.083
Never send your password.

125
00:08:25.539 --> 00:08:30.249
Here's a quick confidence check. Pause the
video and find your next saved visit.

126
00:08:30.799 --> 00:08:32.849
Can you read its date, time, and status?

127
00:08:33.319 --> 00:08:37.589
Can you find Add or Cancel Date, Download
PDF, and Message Bravo?

128
00:08:37.899 --> 00:08:40.969
You don't have to change anything to
practice finding those controls.

129
00:08:41.539 --> 00:08:46.049
When you're ready to make a real change,
remember the routine: choose, review,

130
00:08:46.299 --> 00:08:47.369
save, and verify.

131
00:08:50.831 --> 00:08:55.131
You now know how to sign in, create your own
password, plan training days, move

132
00:08:55.131 --> 00:08:58.521
a visit, cancel a day, and discard an
unsaved mistake.

133
00:08:59.091 --> 00:09:02.661
You also know where to check coverage,
download your schedule, and reach Bravo.

134
00:09:03.151 --> 00:09:04.581
Take it one step at a time.

135
00:09:04.971 --> 00:09:08.331
Your calendar tells you what is saved, and
the team is there when you need a

136
00:09:08.331 --> 00:09:11.381
hand. Trust. Train. Deploy.
